{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Mistress Of The Tower</strong>, a school for... dubious wizards, to learn how to build huge towers to light up the world. Well... in theory. In practice, expect spectacular collapses and twisted challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 Build, stack, but above all... hold on! Accumulate maximum points as you erect your tower. But beware: a poorly thought-out structure is guaranteed to collapse in a cloud of dust and debris!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 Unforgiving laws of physics Each block obeys gravity, forces, collisions... and your clumsiness. One wrong move and you're guaranteed disaster! Place your blocks with precision and strategy to avoid chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 Every block you place earns you points, and every block you lose is penalized. In these conditions, your challenge can quickly turn into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 With your tower, reach your team's bonuses and dodge malus to preserve your blocks from destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 Want to relax? Stacker mode is for you! Simply stack your blocks in peace and good spirits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 Want to fight? Builder mode is for you! The turrets are coming! Ignite, freeze, and shock the insolent ones who dare to attack you! Protect your tower and become the greatest builder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 To add variety, 3 levels of difficulty and 3 challenges:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Infinite Tower (the only limit to the height of your tower is your incompetence);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tower of Time (build the tallest tower before time runs out);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chubby Tower (build the tallest tower without exceeding the height limit).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In short, only stuff related to towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 Alone or with friends, let the competition begin! Play solo or take on up to 4 friends locally:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Keyboard: Up to 4 players (watch out for pudgy fingers and cheaters!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udfae Controller: Up to 2 players per controller</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to take on the challenge and defy the laws of balance?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Happy magical New Year in <strong>Mistress Of The Tower</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3409270?t=1759309505","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3409270?t=1759309505","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409270/18a9198beaa9cfe8c3d2f6b6f015b8f3e0e0e827/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759309505","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409270/18a9198beaa9cfe8c3d2f6b6f015b8f3e0e0e827/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759309505","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","deta