ficulty and 3 challenges:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Infinite Tower (the only limit to the height of your tower is your incompetence);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tower of Time (build the tallest tower before time runs out);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chubby Tower (build the tallest tower without exceeding the height limit).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In short, only stuff related to towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 Alone or with friends, let the competition begin! Play solo or take on up to 4 friends locally:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Keyboard: Up to 4 players (watch out for pudgy fingers and cheaters!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udfae Controller: Up to 2 players per controller</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to take on the challenge and defy the laws of balance?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Happy magical New Year in <strong>Mistress Of The Tower</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Pipot Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409270/header.jpg?t=1759309505","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3 an up<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics an up<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<